SUMMARY:In the Other Room: Bill Squire
LOCATION:Helium Comedy Club\, 3070 Windward Plaza\, Portland
DESCRIPTION:In 2004\, at age 22\, Bill Squire was just your regular old exc
 ommunicated Mormon Missionary trying to find his way through life. Returnin
 g from a two-year-long Mormon mission in the Philippines\, Bill found his v
 oice on stage traveling the country telling jokes as he relentlessly pursue
 d stage time.\n\nBill has several Comedy Specials and Albums that have been
  viewed and listened to millions of times.\n\nBill has been seen on Comedy 
 Central. He was a regular cast member on the cult favorite YouTube series M
 an in the Box\, starring opposite Cleveland Comedy Legend and Red Lobster r
 egular Mike Polk Jr. He has also appeared on tv shows like Laughs on Fox an
 d Hulu.\n\nFamily is a priority for Bill\, although his time on the road me
 ans a lot to him since 2013 Bill has co-hosted The Alan Cox Show\, an after
 noon drive talk show on 100.7 WMMS in Cleveland. He has become a part of a 
 larger family of millions of devoted listeners/viewers on iHeartRadio\, Sir
 iusXM\, Pandora\, Spotify\, Apple Podcasts\, Stitcher. He also co-hosts his
  wildly popular podcast Cleveland America with friends Tommi LC and OkPants
 .\n\nThere is a two-item per person minimum in the Showroom\, which can be 
 fulfilled with any food or drink items from the menu.\n\nPLEASE NOTE: Food 
 and drinks purchased in the bar and lounge do not count towards the two-ite
 m minimum.\n\nManagement reserves the right to prevent customers from enter
 ing the facility who they deem disruptive or dangerous to other patrons.\nM
